description:
Implement a `Semaphore` class that limits concurrency. `acquire()` resolves when a slot is available; `release()` frees a slot and wakes a waiter.

**Example:**
```js
const sem = new Semaphore(2);
await sem.acquire(); // slot 1
await sem.acquire(); // slot 2
// sem.acquire() would now wait until release() is called
sem.release();
```

